        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/leperkhan/{size}/1894_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-18T03:54:51.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>It was fun reading through all of this again now that the Pre-Order has been announced. Lots of easy clues about the VotM in here, and with Voss showing up in a different form in Tactics...could it possibly be HIS shadow on the Broken City box? Not really the right shape imo, but you never know.</p><p>Christopher, it's been a month since you did this...seems like it's probably time for another one, right? =P Yay, new traditions???</p>",
