        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/xxvz/{size}/2367_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-18T14:25:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Christopher\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/christopher/48/1851_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> Christopher:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<blockquote>If you were forced to change how any one card in Sentinels of the Multiverse, which one would it be and what would it be changed to? (Not including errata)\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote>\nI would give Cursed Acolyte a pompadour.\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Just thought I'd point out how that blue guy in VotM also has a pompadour.</p>\n<p>If this was a spoiler, well done for being sneaky about it!</p>",
